WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.094 --> 00:00:16.617
After the Tang Monk sent Wukong away, he and the others continued west.

2
00:00:19.818 --> 00:00:21.880
Later that day they stopped to rest.

3
00:00:27.843 --> 00:00:29.864
sat down in the grass next to the road.

4
00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:34.118
He let out a great big yawn.

5
00:00:34.198 --> 00:00:37.461
"Bajie," said the Tang Monk.

6
00:00:39.002 --> 00:00:40.423
don't you go find us some food?

7
00:00:41.424 --> 00:00:42.545
Wujing and I will wait here."

8
00:00:43.826 --> 00:00:44.526
pig moaned.

9
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:46.948
"Ugh! I just sat down!"

10
00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:51.011
He got back up.

11
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:55.235
journey is too difficult," he said.

12
00:00:56.316 --> 00:00:58.037
Then he wandered off.

13
00:01:00.439 --> 00:01:03.037
a few minutes of walking, Bajie looked around.

14
00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:05.919
He was all alone.

15
00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:10.323
"I'm too tired to look for food," he said to himself.

16
00:01:10.343 --> 00:01:14.186
"But if I go back now, Master will be angry."

17
00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:19.530
yawned. "I'll take a nap.

18
00:01:20.611 --> 00:01:22.552
When I wake up, I'll go back to Master.

19
00:01:23.753 --> 00:01:26.836
I'll tell him I searched everywhere but couldn't find any food."

20
00:01:37.048 --> 00:01:38.970
pig lay down behind some bushes.

21
00:01:42.132 --> 00:01:43.993
Soon he was snoring loudly.

22
00:01:48.176 --> 00:01:52.159
An hour later the Tang Monk and Wujing were still waiting by the road.

23
00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:56.822
"What is taking Bajie so long?"

24
00:01:57.162 --> 00:01:57.743
asked the monk.

25
00:01:58.904 --> 00:02:00.124
Wujing looked annoyed.

26
00:02:00.144 --> 00:02:04.768
"He probably found food and is now eating it all himself.

27
00:02:05.896 --> 00:02:07.037
I'll go and look for him."

28
00:02:09.199 --> 00:02:11.560
Wujing got up and headed down the road.

29
00:02:17.865 --> 00:02:18.905
said a voice suddenly.

30
00:02:18.925 --> 00:02:21.047
"Yummy noodles!"

31
00:02:22.348 --> 00:02:23.468
Wujing frowned.

32
00:02:23.488 --> 00:02:25.910
"That's Bajie.

33
00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:29.713
He find food, and he's not sharing it with us!"

34
00:02:31.914 --> 00:02:34.176
Meanwhile the Tang Monk became bored.

35
00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:37.454
stood up to stretch his legs.

36
00:02:39.135 --> 00:02:39.976
He looked around.

37
00:02:40.997 --> 00:02:43.719
"This is a beautiful forest," he said to himself.

38
00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:45.661
"I'll take a short walk."

39
00:02:50.064 --> 00:02:54.788
The monk walked quietly through the woods, admiring flowers and plants as he went.

40
00:02:58.491 --> 00:03:00.753
He went deeper and deeper into the forest.

41
00:03:03.576 --> 00:03:07.522
Then, in the midst of all the trees, he saw a pagoda.

42
00:03:07.542 --> 00:03:11.185
"This is a strange place for a pagoda," he thought.

43
00:03:11.205 --> 00:03:14.167
"Maybe we can all stay here tonight."

44
00:03:17.909 --> 00:03:20.711
The Tang Monk went to the door of the pagoda and opened it.

45
00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:26.355
He gasped.

46
00:03:26.975 --> 00:03:28.956
A monster was sleeping inside!

47
00:03:29.977 --> 00:03:33.700
The monster had a purple beard and long, sharp fangs.

48
00:03:35.084 --> 00:03:38.346
The Tang Monk tried to walk away, but the monster woke up.

49
00:03:40.047 --> 00:03:41.949
there?" called the monster.

50
00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:43.710
He stood up.

51
00:03:45.231 --> 00:03:48.113
The Tang Monk turned around, shaking with fear.

52
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:51.435
"Sorry to wake you," he said.

53
00:03:51.455 --> 00:03:56.539
"I, uh The monster came closer and smiled.

54
00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.801
a monk," he said.

55
00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:04.528
He licked his lips.

56
00:04:04.608 --> 00:04:06.149
"Y-yes," said the Tang Monk.

57
00:04:06.349 --> 00:04:07.729
"I'm from the T-Tang Empire.

58
00:04:07.749 --> 00:04:10.750
I monster's eyes lit up.

59
00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.331
"You're the Tang Monk!"

60
00:04:15.811 --> 00:04:19.052
Meanwhile Wujing stomped toward Bajie's voice.

61
00:04:21.513 --> 00:04:25.074
He peered behind some bushes and saw the pig fast asleep.

62
00:04:27.595 --> 00:04:28.875
I have more tofu?"

63
00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:30.095
asked Bajie.

64
00:04:31.296 --> 00:04:33.752
He was talking in his sleep.

65
00:04:34.213 --> 00:04:35.273
please cook lots more.

66
00:04:35.554 --> 00:04:36.534
I will eat it all."

67
00:04:38.415 --> 00:04:39.696
Wujing kicked the pig.

68
00:04:39.716 --> 00:04:41.057
"Wake up!"

69
00:04:42.598 --> 00:04:46.441
Bajie jumped to his feet, wiping drool from the side of his mouth.

70
00:04:46.461 --> 00:04:49.963
"How dare you sleep while we wait for you?"

71
00:04:50.263 --> 00:04:51.084
said Wujing.

72
00:04:51.104 --> 00:04:53.766
"Now let's go back to Master."

73
00:04:56.127 --> 00:04:56.888
pig sighed.

74
00:04:57.829 --> 00:05:03.108
With his head hung low, he followed Wujing back to the road.

75
00:05:03.168 --> 00:05:05.849
But when they got there, the Tang Monk was gone.

76
00:05:09.411 --> 00:05:11.532
he went for a walk," said Wujing.

77
00:05:13.692 --> 00:05:16.734
He and Bajie wandered through the woods, looking for the monk.

78
00:05:19.275 --> 00:05:21.096
Soon they saw the pagoda.

79
00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:25.637
They knocked on the door, and the monster answered.

80
00:05:25.657 --> 00:05:29.899
"Who are you?"

81
00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.340
asked the monster.

82
00:05:32.757 --> 00:05:34.320
told the monster who they were.

83
00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.424
"We're looking for a monk."

84
00:05:37.587 --> 00:05:38.729
The monster laughed.

85
00:05:39.871 --> 00:05:40.953
have a monk here.

86
00:05:42.255 --> 00:05:43.778
I'm going to eat him for
